    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n45193" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εὕστρα</span></b>  or <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εὔστρα</span></b>  (<i><span class="en">
			<u>EM</u>
			398.31
		</span></i>), ἡ: (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εὕω</span>):—<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>place for singeing slaughtered swine</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>Eq.</u>
				1236
			</span></i> (pl.). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>roasted barley</i>, from which <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄλφιτα</span> were made, <i><span class="en">
				Paus.Gr.
				<u>Fr.</u>
				184
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				<u>EM</u>
				90.31
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> a kind of
				<i>pulse,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				PTeb.
				9.14
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				11.9
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(ii B. C.)</span>.</div>
